LeetCode
________________________________________________________________________________

A collection of LeetCode problems and their solutions as I complete them in an
orderly fashion.

[000] Index
________________________________________________________________________________

* Dependencies ........................................................... [001]
* Testing ................................................................ [002]

[001] Dependencies
________________________________________________________________________________

All problems are solved in Go with the standard library, and tested via the
Makefile.

* Go   [https://go.dev/learn/]
* Make [https://www.gnu.org/software/make/]

[002] Testing
________________________________________________________________________________

Each problem set has an associated *_test.go file which contains the example test
cases and a simple test suite for executing the solution against the provided
example cases.

To run the tests:

+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                              |
|   $ make test         # To run the tests once                                |
|   $ make count=n test # To run the tests n times                             |
|                                                                              |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
